            "id": "6aba2ac8f6bf6a01ecd7a2c1",
            "uuid": "4fd2eece-06f5-4055-be7d-13c497111849",
            "title": "从 README 到第一次启动：读懂开源项目的最短路径",
            "slug": "cong-readme-dao-di-yi-ci-qi-dong-du-dong-kai-yuan-xiang-mu-de-zui-duan-lu-jing",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"拿到一个开源项目时，先不要急着修改代码。我们应先确认 README、Release、许可证与兼容矩阵。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"建立基线\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"extended-heading\",\"version\":1,\"tag\":\"h2\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"记录固定版本、启动命令和未修改时的页面，后续每次变化才有比较对象。本文的检索关键词是：可复现工程。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>拿到一个开源项目时，先不要急着修改代码。我们应先确认 README、Release、许可证与兼容矩阵。</p><h2 id=\"%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E5%9F%BA%E7%BA%BF\">建立基线</h2><p>记录固定版本、启动命令和未修改时的页面，后续每次变化才有比较对象。本文的检索关键词是：可复现工程。</p>",
            "comment_id": "6aba2ac8f6bf6a01ecd7a2c1",
            "plaintext": "拿到一个开源项目时，先不要急着修改代码。我们应先确认 README、Release、许可证与兼容矩阵。\n\n\n建立基线\n\n记录固定版本、启动命令和未修改时的页面，后续每次变化才有比较对象。本文的检索关键词是：可复现工程。",
            "feature_image": null,
            "featured": 0,
            "type": "post",
            "status": "published",
            "locale": null,
            "visibility": "public",
            "email_recipient_filter": "all",
            "created_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:24",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:24",
            "published_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:26",
            "custom_excerpt": "用版本、许可证和运行证据建立可靠的开源项目基线。",
            "codeinjection_head": null,
            "codeinjection_foot": null,
