          {
            "id": "6aba2acbf6bf6a01ecd7a2c8",
            "uuid": "c68668b6-8ef1-4c85-9577-3316d6a25294",
            "title": "为什么二次开发应该优先选择稳定扩展边界而不是直接修改核心源码",
            "slug": "wei-shi-yao-er-ci-kai-fa-ying-gai-you-xian-xuan-ze-wen-ding-kuo-zhan-bian-jie-er-bu-shi-zhi-jie-xiu-gai-he-xin-yuan-ma",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"直接修改核心会让每次升级都变成一次艰难的合并。主题、插件和公开 API 是更稳定的扩展边界。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"好的二次开发，既能看见变化，也能解释边界。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"extended-quote\",\"version\":1},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"本项目把相关推荐放在主题服务端查询中，避免改动 Ghost 核心。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>直接修改核心会让每次升级都变成一次艰难的合并。主题、插件和公开 API 是更稳定的扩展边界。</p><blockquote>好的二次开发，既能看见变化，也能解释边界。</blockquote><p>本项目把相关推荐放在主题服务端查询中，避免改动 Ghost 核心。</p>",
            "comment_id": "6aba2acbf6bf6a01ecd7a2c8",
            "plaintext": "直接修改核心会让每次升级都变成一次艰难的合并。主题、插件和公开 API 是更稳定的扩展边界。\n\n好的二次开发，既能看见变化，也能解释边界。\n\n本项目把相关推荐放在主题服务端查询中，避免改动 Ghost 核心。",
            "feature_image": null,
            "featured": 0,
            "type": "post",
            "status": "published",
            "locale": null,
            "visibility": "public",
            "email_recipient_filter": "all",
            "created_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:27",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:27",
            "published_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:27",
            "custom_excerpt": "从升级成本和责任边界分析主题扩展的价值。",
            "codeinjection_head": null,
            "codeinjection_foot": null,
