          {
            "id": "6aba2acbf6bf6a01ecd7a2cd",
            "uuid": "a2c7bd09-0de8-4e40-afd0-3ea1fa22372a",
            "title": "Ghost 主题目录结构速查",
            "slug": "ghost-zhu-ti-mu-lu-jie-gou-su-cha",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Ghost 主题以 Handlebars 模板组织页面。default.hbs 提供布局，index.hbs 负责首页，post.hbs 负责文章详情。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1},{\"type\":\"codeblock\",\"version\":1,\"code\":\"theme/\\\\n  assets/\\\\n  partials/\\\\n  post.hbs\\\\n  package.json\",\"language\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"静态资源通过 asset 助手生成正确路径。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>Ghost 主题以 Handlebars 模板组织页面。default.hbs 提供布局，index.hbs 负责首页，post.hbs 负责文章详情。</p><pre><code>theme/\\n  assets/\\n  partials/\\n  post.hbs\\n  package.json</code></pre><p>静态资源通过 asset 助手生成正确路径。</p>",
            "comment_id": "6aba2acbf6bf6a01ecd7a2cd",
            "plaintext": "Ghost 主题以 Handlebars 模板组织页面。default.hbs 提供布局，index.hbs 负责首页，post.hbs 负责文章详情。\n\ntheme/\\n  assets/\\n  partials/\\n  post.hbs\\n  package.json\n\n静态资源通过 asset 助手生成正确路径。",
            "feature_image": null,
            "featured": 0,
            "type": "post",
            "status": "published",
            "locale": null,
            "visibility": "public",
            "email_recipient_filter": "all",
