            "id": "6aba2acbf6bf6a01ecd7a2d4",
            "uuid": "8835f4fb-bb9b-4350-9f96-5d437386e3f4",
            "title": "用 GScan 把主题兼容问题挡在提交之前",
            "slug": "yong-gscan-ba-zhu-ti-jian-rong-wen-ti-dang-zai-ti-jiao-zhi-qian",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"GScan 会检查必需模板、编辑器宽幅样式、主题版本和辅助函数兼容性。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"修复闭环\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"extended-heading\",\"version\":1,\"tag\":\"h2\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"第一次检查发现宽幅卡片样式缺失；补齐后再次执行，结果兼容 Ghost 6.x。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>GScan 会检查必需模板、编辑器宽幅样式、主题版本和辅助函数兼容性。</p><h2 id=\"%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E9%97%AD%E7%8E%AF\">修复闭环</h2><p>第一次检查发现宽幅卡片样式缺失；补齐后再次执行，结果兼容 Ghost 6.x。</p>",
            "comment_id": "6aba2acbf6bf6a01ecd7a2d4",
            "plaintext": "GScan 会检查必需模板、编辑器宽幅样式、主题版本和辅助函数兼容性。\n\n\n修复闭环\n\n第一次检查发现宽幅卡片样式缺失；补齐后再次执行，结果兼容 Ghost 6.x。",
