            "id": "6aba2accf6bf6a01ecd7a2de",
            "uuid": "fb2180dd-e366-4a7b-ab64-166bf24d043f",
            "title": "一次 SQLite 本地安装故障的定位记录",
            "slug": "yi-ci-sqlite-ben-di-an-zhuang-gu-zhang-de-ding-wei-ji-lu",
            "mobiledoc": null,
            "lexical": "{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Ghost CLI 首先报告找不到 Python。检查源码后发现它调用的是 python3，而 Windows 只有 python 命令。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"补充命令入口后，进一步发现 sqlite3 预编译包下载中断。最终校验官方发布资产并恢复二进制加载。\",\"type\":\"extended-text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}}",
            "html": "<p>Ghost CLI 首先报告找不到 Python。检查源码后发现它调用的是 python3，而 Windows 只有 python 命令。</p><p>补充命令入口后，进一步发现 sqlite3 预编译包下载中断。最终校验官方发布资产并恢复二进制加载。</p>",
            "comment_id": "6aba2accf6bf6a01ecd7a2de",
            "plaintext": "Ghost CLI 首先报告找不到 Python。检查源码后发现它调用的是 python3，而 Windows 只有 python 命令。\n\n补充命令入口后，进一步发现 sqlite3 预编译包下载中断。最终校验官方发布资产并恢复二进制加载。",
            "feature_image": null,
            "featured": 0,
            "type": "post",
            "status": "published",
            "locale": null,
            "visibility": "public",
            "email_recipient_filter": "all",
            "created_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:28",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:28",
            "published_at": "2026-09-28 08:52:28",
            "custom_excerpt": "从 Python 预检到预编译二进制，记录完整排障链路。",
            "codeinjection_head": null,
            "codeinjection_foot": null,
